{% extends "layout.j2" %}
{% block main_content %}
<section class="hero-section">
  <h1>Welcome to Acacia</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">A learning platform built on the Feynman Technique — master complex concepts through simple explanations, analogies, and active recall.</p>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text)">How It Works</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="ghost-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="step-number" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-accent);color:#fff;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem">1</div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Choose a Topic</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Pick from <strong>Compliance</strong> (AML, sanctions, KYC), <strong>Markets</strong> (microstructure, volatility, trading), or <strong>Data Engineering</strong> (pipelines, streaming, schemas).</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ghost-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="step-number" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-accent);color:#fff;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem">2</div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Learn Step by Step</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Every concept starts with a plain-English explanation (ELI5), then builds through analogies, real examples, diagrams, and reflective questions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ghost-card p-5 text-center">
      <div class="step-number" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-accent);color:#fff;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem">3</div>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Prove You Understand</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Teach back what you learned, complete build exercises, and track your mastery through spaced repetition and gap detection.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text)">The Feynman Technique</h2>
  <div class="ghost-card p-5" style="border-left:4px solid #d97706">
    <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.7">
      <strong style="color:var(--color-text)">&ldquo;If you can't explain it simply, you don't understand it well enough.&rdquo;</strong>
      &mdash; Richard Feynman
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm mb-3" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.7">
      The Feynman Technique is a four-step method for learning anything deeply:
    </p>
    <ol class="text-sm space-y-2" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">
      <li><strong style="color:var(--color-text)">Choose a concept</strong> &mdash; pick something you want to learn.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--color-text)">Explain it to a child</strong> &mdash; use simple language, no jargon.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--color-text)">Identify gaps</strong> &mdash; where did you struggle? Go back to the source.</li>
      <li><strong style="color:var(--color-text)">Review and simplify</strong> &mdash; refine your explanation, find better analogies.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="text-sm mt-3" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.7">
      Acacia extends this into six progressive stages: <strong style="color:var(--color-text)">Explain &rarr; Analogize &rarr; Exemplify &rarr; Diagram &rarr; Find Gaps &rarr; Build &rarr; Teach Back</strong>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text)">Where to Start</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <a href="/compliance/" class="pillar-card ghost-card p-4 no-underline block" style="border-top:3px solid var(--color-aml, #f97316)">
      <span class="pillar-icon" style="font-size:1.5rem">&#127991;</span>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mt-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">AML &amp; Compliance</h3>
      <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary)">Financial crime prevention, KYC, sanctions screening, transaction monitoring.</p>
      <span class="difficulty-badge beginner mt-2 inline-block">Beginner friendly</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/markets/" class="pillar-card ghost-card p-4 no-underline block" style="border-top:3px solid var(--color-markets, #34d399)">
      <span class="pillar-icon" style="font-size:1.5rem">&#128200;</span>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mt-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Markets &amp; Trading</h3>
      <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary)">Market microstructure, volatility analysis, quantitative methods, trading strategies.</p>
      <span class="difficulty-badge beginner mt-2 inline-block">Beginner friendly</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/data/" class="pillar-card ghost-card p-4 no-underline block" style="border-top:3px solid var(--color-data-engineering, #818cf8)">
      <span class="pillar-icon" style="font-size:1.5rem">&#128421;</span>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mt-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Data Engineering</h3>
      <p class="text-xs mt-1" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary)">Pipeline architecture, streaming, batch processing, storage formats, data quality.</p>
      <span class="difficulty-badge beginner mt-2 inline-block">Beginner friendly</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text)">Learning Tips</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="ghost-card p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Start with ELI5</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Every concept has an "Explain Like I'm 5" section. Read that first. If you can't understand the ELI5, find a simpler prerequisite concept.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ghost-card p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Use the Learning Paths</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Feynman Learning Paths organize concepts into progressive stages. Follow them in order for the best results.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ghost-card p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Test Yourself</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Use the Teach Back and Build exercise sections. Writing your own explanation is the best way to find gaps in your understanding.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ghost-card p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Track Your Progress</h3>
      <p class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6">Visit <a href="/review/" style="color:var(--color-accent)">My Progress</a> to see your mastery across all concepts and get personalized review recommendations.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="ghost-card p-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-base font-bold mb-2" style="color:var(--color-text)">Ready to start learning?</h2>
    <p class="text-sm mb-4" style="color:var(--color-text-secondary)">Pick a topic above or explore the full knowledge base.</p>
    <a href="/search/" class="hero-cta">Browse All Topics &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
